{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04765","headline":"同刘给事城南宴集 · 张说","name":"同刘给事城南宴集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水竹幽闲地，簪缨近侍臣。\n雍容乘暇日，潇洒出嚣尘。\n树对思朋鸟，池深入养鳞。\n管弦高逐吹，歌舞妙含春。\n老子叨专席，欢邀隔缙绅。\n此中情不浅，遥寄赏心人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04765.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04765","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}